   "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InboxMessageResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "message_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a80",\n                    "code": "WITHDRAW_PAID",\n                    "title": "提现已到账",\n                    "body": "你的提现已到账",\n                    "created_at": "2026-10-02T09:30:00+08:00",\n                    "read_at": null,\n                    "route": {\n                      "route": "WithdrawRecords",\n                      "params": {}\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/messages": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "listMessages",\n        "tags": [\n          "content"\n        ],\n        "summary": "My inbox messages",\n        "description": "In-app messages of the logged-in account, newest first (created_at, then message_id, both\\ndescending; 04 §6.4 站内消息). Each item has the same fields as GET\\n/v1/messages/{message_id}: message_id, code, title, body, created_at, read_at (null =\\nunread) and route ({route, params} or null). Listing does not change read_at.\\n`next_cursor` fetches the next (older) page; null means no more. A malformed or foreign\\ncursor is 20001 with data.fields=[cursor]. Messages are written whatever the push\\nsettings are (GET /v1/me/notification-settings). Not signed and no Idempotency-Key: a\\nread of the use