ter_unavailable(self) is true\\n(BR-INV-02) can_invite=false and invite_code, landing_url and poster_url are null while\\ndirect_count is still returned; the client shows \\"暂不可邀请\\" without a reason.\\nlanding_url is `{a current share domain}/i/{invite_code}` and may carry a channel code\\nparameter; it never contains the UID, the phone number or the nickname. poster_url is the\\nposter image drawn by the server (04 §6.4, TECH-13); null while poster drawing is not\\navailable.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "phone",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10005,\n          30413\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "My invite information.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MyInviteResponse"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "can_invite": {\n                    "summary": "Can invite",\n                    "value": {\n                      "code": 0,\n                      "msg": "",\n           