e code\\nfailure does not use up the SMS code. already_registered changes no relation and tells\\nnothing more; an account in the deletion cooling period or processing counts as\\nregistered, a phone whose only account finished deletion counts as new. The same IP or\\nphone_hmac counts every 30401 (BR-INV-02). No token is issued; the page sends the user to\\nthe app to log in with the same number. Idempotency subject `p:<phone_hmac>` (04 §5).\\nNot signed. Version gate: 不判定：落地页 (written false, BR-ID-01 细则).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-min-version-gate": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10004,\n          30408,\n          42901,\n          20001,\n          30401,\n          20002,\n          20003,\n          44001\n        ],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LandingRegisterRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "phone": "13800138000",\n                "sms_code": "246810",\n                "invite_code": "K7M2QX",\n                "agreed": true,\n                "channel": "wx_group_01"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses":