rify page (opened only by a page that got 10010; BR-WDR-01 细则「旧手机号被二次\\n放号时的提现加验」). `required` is false when the account has no re-verification flag or\\nthis device is already re-verified; then `method`, `fail_limit` and `fail_remaining` are\\nnull and `providers` is empty. Otherwise `method` (reverify_method) is the one available\\nway by priority (trusted identities with a real name → id_number; else with a third-party\\nidentity → oauth; else manual; also manual once the failure limit is reached for the day),\\n`providers` lists the trusted third-party identities when method=oauth (empty otherwise),\\nand `fail_limit` / `fail_remaining` give the consecutive failure limit and what is left\\ntoday (+08:00), null for manual.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The re-verification state.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReverifyStatusResponse"\n                },\n     