ed or mismatching credential or attempt → 20004; the provider\\nunavailable, or its answer lacking the required identifier → 50305 with `data.provider`.\\nPending re-verification (BR-WDR-01 细则「旧手机号被二次放号时的提现加验」, 位置与返回码): the\\naccount carries the flag and this device is not a re-verified device → 10010 with\\n`data.method` (only one, by priority: id_number, oauth, manual), judged before the\\ncredential is exchanged; the client opens Reverify and, after passing, the user binds\\nagain with a new Idempotency-Key (no replay). 10010 writes no idempotency result\\n(BR-WDR-07). An identity bound while the flag is set never becomes a trusted identity.\\nConflicts (BR-ID-06 细则): an identity already bound to another account, or a provider\\nalready bound to this account (unique (app_id, user_id, provider)), is refused without\\nmerging; their error codes are not yet allocated in 08 §13.11 and are to be decided when\\nthe P1 item is started (待 P1 立项定). On success one user_oauth row is written\\n(Apple also stores its refresh token, BR-ID-04) and the binding is returned.\\nVersion gate: applied.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "login",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          20004,\n          10010,\n          50305,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n      