 },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/me/realname": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "submitRealname",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Real-name verification (name and ID number)",\n        "description": "Two-element verification of name plus an 18-digit resident ID number, no face check\\n(BR-ID-25). The client only offers it when the user first enters a withdrawal or binds a\\npayout account while realname_status≠verified; no other entry may ask for the ID number.\\nPreconditions: no phone bound → 10005, checked before the consent (a member without phone\\nnever gets 10004 or 30406, BR-ID-01 细则); no id_verification consent → 10004 with\\ndata.consent_type=id_verification. Then, first hit wins (BR-ID-25): 20001 format (18\\ndigits and check digit; the format is judged by the server, not by the request schema,\\nso that 10005 / 10004 come first) → 30407 age (computed locally from the ID number,\\nBR-ID-26) → 30410 today\'s attempts used up → 30405 (the ID number is already verified on\\nanother account of this app; that account is never revealed) → vendor call. At most 3\\nattempts per user per natural day (+08:00): a vendor call with a definite result (match or\\nmismatch) counts 1, 30405 counts 1 (no vendor call); 20001, 30407 and vendor timeout or\\nerror (50401 / 50301) do not count. The verification service being unavailable, including\\nnot yet connected, is 50301 and does not count. A mismatch is 30406. A failed attempt\\nkeeps neither the name nor the ID number. After verified the user cannot change it\\nthemselves (corrections only by customer service in the admin console); a resubmission\\nafter verified passes 10005 / 10004 and then answers 200 with the stored masked name,\\nignoring the submitted values, without a vendor call or an attempt. A mismatch leaves the\\nuser\'s realname_status failed. The name and the ID number never go into logs. The client\\nfetches GET /v1/me again after success. An account flagged for re-verification (旧号加验)\\non a device not yet re-verified → 10010 with data.method on the first real-name\\nverification (BR-WDR-01 细则「位置与返回码」); no idempotency result is written (BR-WDR-07).\\nVersion gate: applied.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "phone",\n        "x-signed": true,\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10005,\n          10004,\n          20001,\n          30407,\n          30410,\n          30405,\n          30406,\n          50401,\n          50301,\n          10405,\n          10010\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Timestamp"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Nonce"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Sign"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRealnameRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "name": "张三",\n                "id_no": "11010519491231002X"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Verified.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRealnameResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "realname_status": "verified",\n                    "masked_name": "**三"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/me/labor-agreement": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "getLaborAgreement",\n        "tags": [\n          "identity"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Current labor agreement and whether I must sign it",\n        "description": "The currently effective labor agreement version, the address of its full text, its sha256\\nand whether the user must sign (BR-WDR-31; 04 §6.1). need_sign is true when the user has\\nnever signed, or when the latest signature\'s version is below the re-sign threshold\\n(resign_from_version, the first version that requires a new signature); a higher current\\nversion that has not reached the threshold leaves a signed user with need_sign=false\\n(08 BR-WDR-31: one signature stays valid until a version marked as requiring a new\\nsignature is published). signed_version / signed_at are the latest signature, null when\\nnever signed. The version comes from server configuration; the\\ncontract does not promise how it is managed in the admin console. Native App only, the\\nsame as signing (04 §6.1): an h5_token gets 10403 even though this is a read. Not\\nrealname → 30304.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "realname",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          30304,\n          10403\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The current labor agreement and the signing state.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LaborAgreementResponse"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "needSign": {\n                    "summary": "Must sign the current version",\n                    "value": {\n                      "code": 0,\n                      "msg": "",\n              