art_date (the client shows\\nprice_trend.empty); an unknown product key is the same no_data. `source_key` is\\nprice_trend.source, or price_trend.source.general for a product whose detail quote\\ncarries no coupon (BR-PRICE-04); the title key follows the same choice. A `platform`\\nthat is not a platform code, or a product key that does not belong to it, is 20001 with\\ndata.fields.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "none",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [],\n        "security": [],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/ProductKey"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "platform",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": true,\n            "description": "Platform of the product (enum platform).",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlatformCode"\n            }\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The price trend, or no_data.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProductPriceTrendResponse"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n           