n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ShopOpenResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "jump": {\n                      "primary": {\n                        "type": "universal_link",\n                        "value": "https://shop.example.test/s/1001?promo=placeholder"\n                      },\n                      "fallbacks": [],\n                      "expire_at": "2026-11-06T10:45:00+08:00"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/rank/hot": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "getHotRank",\n        "tags": [\n          "trade"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Hot-sales list of one platform",\n        "description": "Hot-sales list of the `HotRankList` page (04 §6.3 `GET /v1/rank/hot`; 规划/01 F-PROD-13;\\nBR-TEXT-13, BR-TEXT-17). The server reads one sales-list channel of the platform, which\\nmust be a selectable channel of the whitelist specs/material-channels.yaml (BR-TEXT-17\\n细则「联盟物料频道」); `channel` names it. `categories` lists the categories that channel\\noffers; `category` in the query takes only a `category_id` from that list (anything else\\nis 20001 with data.fields=[category]). `items` keep the order the channel returned and are\\nnever reordered (`rank` counts from 1 across pages); `sales_text` is the union\'s sales\\nfield passed through unchanged, null when the union gives none (the client then hides the\\nsales line, texts rank.sales.tb / rank.sales.neutral); `notice_key` is rank.notice. Cards\\nhave the shape of a search card (ProductCard) and only register a link with its quote\\nsnapshot, never convert (BR-PRICE-12). Answers are cached by the server for\\nrank.cache_ttl_seconds. A platform with no compliant channel answers 50304 with\\ndata.reason=rank_unavailable and is left out of /v1/config features.rank_platforms; a\\nunion failure without a usable cache answers 50304 without reason (retry later). The\\nproduct pool is never served as the hot list. Page size 20 (no limit parameter); a\\nmalformed or foreign cursor is 20001 with data.fields=[cursor]. `x-auth` is optional\\nalthough 04 listed none earlier: rebate amounts are computed for the current user\\n(BR-PRICE-11, D10-462; 08 wins over 04). A request without a token is a guest.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          20001,\n          50304\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "name": "platform",\n            "in": "query",\n            "required": true,\n            "description": "Platform of the list (enum platform).",\n            "schema": {\n              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PlatformCode"\n            }\n          },\n      