ailure_reason\\nsaying so, narrow the filters) and `admin.export.max_running_per_admin` (tasks of one\\ncreator generated at the same time; the rest stay pending until a slot frees up).\\nLifecycle (enum export_status): pending → running → done or failed; done → expired 24\\nhours after the file was generated (BR-ID-30 ⑨, the object-storage lifecycle rule deletes\\nthe file); pending or running → cancelled when the creator\'s account is disabled (with an\\naudit record); failed → pending by POST /admin/v1/exports/{id}/retry. There is no cancel\\noperation.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10003,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminStepUpToken"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminExportCreateRequest"\n              },\n              "examples": {\n                "users": {\n                  "summary": "Export the frozen users, masked",\n                  "value": {\n                    "resource": "users",\n                    "filters": {\n                      "risk_state": "frozen"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "usersUnmasked": {\n                  "summary": "Export users with full phone numbers (pii.reveal_phone and step-up)",\n                  "value": {\n                    "resource": "users",\n                    "filters": {\n                      "risk_state": "banned"\n                    },\n                    "unmasked": true,\n                    "reason": "配合公安机关调取封禁账号的注册手机号"\n             