ble / enable operations take as `expected_row_version`. Orders, balance,\\nledger and withdrawals of the user come with the order and fund consoles and are not part\\nof this schema yet.\\nCT-26k (D10-517) adds the 「基本信息」 fields of the console\'s user detail:\\n`realname_status`, `masked_name` and `masked_id_no` (BR-ID-33: name with only the last\\ncharacter, ID number first 1 + last 1; both null unless realname_status is verified) and\\n`payout_account` (the current payout account masked as in GET /v1/me/payout-account, null\\nwhen none is bound), plus `deletion_status` (the user\'s latest deletion request, BR-ID-27 /\\nBR-ID-28; null when none). The full values stay with the audited reveal. This operation\\nis implemented; the five new fields are 实现另单 and stay optional until that\\nimplementation is merged.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminUserIdPath"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The user.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminUserDetailResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c02",\n                    "nickname": "凑狸用户0000",\n                    "phone_masked": "139****0000",\n                    "invite_code": "P3RT8N"