elf has revoked_at null. `last_seen_at` descending (then the\\nserver\'s internal order for the same time), page by page (`page`, `page_size` ≤ 200, above\\nthat 20001). Each row: `device_id`, `platform`, `app_version`, `created_at`,\\n`last_seen_at` and `reverified` — the device\'s re-verified record (`source` self / admin\\nand `created_at`, BR-WDR-01 细则「已加验设备」) or null; never device_hash, the install\\nsecret or last_login_sid. An unknown `user_id`, or one of another app, is 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[user_id]`. This is where the console picks the `device_id` it records as\\nre-verified.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminUserIdPath"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPage"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPageSize"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "One page of the user\'s devices, most recently seen first.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminUserDevicePageResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "items": [\n                      {\n                        "device_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a60",\n                        "platform": "ios",\n                        "app_ve