epUpRequiredTotp"\n                  },\n                  "unknownUser": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminUnknownUser"\n                  },\n                  "reasonMissing": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminUserReasonInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "unknownDevice": {\n                    "summary": "20001 device_id unknown, revoked or not a device of this user",\n                    "value": {\n                      "code": 20001,\n                      "msg": "参数错误",\n                      "data": {\n                        "fields": [\n                          "device_id"\n                        ]\n                      },\n                      "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "notPending": {\n                    "summary": "30419 the account carries no pending re-verification flag",\n                    "value": {\n                      "code": 30419,\n                      "msg": "该用户当前不受理这项代办",\n                      "data": {\n                        "reason": "reverify_not_pending"\n                      },\n                      "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/admin/v1/users/{user_id}/realname-correction": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "adminCorrectUserRealname",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-users"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Correct a user\'s real-name data (name and ID number) on the user\'s behalf (audited)",\n        "description": "Permission point `user.realname_fix` (04 §11.2); lacking it is 10403 with\\n`data.reason=admin_permission_denied`. Step-up: totp tier (without a valid totp-tier\\n`X-Step-Up-Token` → 10003 with `data.tier=totp`). The user contacts customer service in a\\nWeCom (企业微信) conversation; the agent checks the user\'s identity there by hand (no\\nsystem verification flow, 2026-10-05) and submits the corrected `name` and `id_no`\\n(18-digit resident ID number) with `reason` (1–200 characters: what was checked in the\\nWeCom conversation). Rules: BR-ID-25 细则「实名更正」.\\nBody checks first: a missing or over-long field is 20001 with `data.fields` naming it. An\\nunknown `user_id`, or one of another app, is 20001 with `data.fields=[user_id]`.\\nNot accepted (judged before the checks below, no vendor call), first hit wins, each 30419\\n(08 §13.11; only in /admin/v1) with `data.reason`: the user\'s realname_status is not\\nverified (`realname_not_verified`; a user who never verified does it in the App); the\\naccount is in the deletion flow (BR-ID-27; also refused in the cooling period): cooling or\\nprocessing is `account_deleting` with `data.stage` (the values of 10007\'s `data.stage`),\\ndone is `account_deleted` without `data.stage`; the user has any withdrawal outside the\\nterminal set of BR-WDR-08 (`withdrawal_in_progress`; finance brings it to a terminal state\\nfirst); the account carries the \\"pending re-verification\\" flag (`reverify_pending`;\\nBR-WDR-01 细则「旧手机号被二次放号时的提现加验」; cleared by hand first); the id_no_hmac of\\nthe current real name is blacklisted (`identity_blacklisted`; BR-ID-31 ID-number\\ndimension; passed to risk control).\\nThen the same order as the user\'s own real-name verification (POST /v1/me/realname):\\n20001 format of `id_no` (18 digits and check digit, `data.fields=[id_no]`) → 44001 the new\\nID number is blacklisted (a console-side refusal: no risk_hits record, not an appealable\\nblocked request, BR-ID-36) → 30407 age (BR-ID-26) → 30405 the new id_no_hmac is verified\\non another account of this app (the user\'s own current value does not count; that\\naccount is never revealed) → vendor two-element verification: a mismatch is 30406 and\\nleaves the stored real name as it was; vendor timeout or error is 50401 / 50301 and saves\\nnothing. Attempts are not counted against the user\'s 3 per day (no 30410 here).\\nOn a match, in one transaction that locks the user row (the same user-level lock as a\\nwithdrawal application): withdrawals are checked again and a new non-terminal one refuses\\nthe correction as above (30419 with `data.reason=withdrawal_in_progress`); when the old identity has a paid-out\\nwithdrawal (PAID_API / PAID_MANUAL), the old name and ID ciphertexts, id_no_hmac and\\nverified_at move to the isolated store first (BR-ID-25 细则「旧身份留存」; viewing it\\ncomes with a later contract); then the realname row\'s name and ID ciphertexts,\\nid_no_hmac, birth_date, provider and verified_at are overwritten, every bound payout\\naccount of the user is invalidated (written to payout_account_changes; this invalidation\\nand the first rebinding after it are not counted in the user\'s monthly changes), and the\\ndomain event `user.realname_corrected` (old and new id_no_hmac, never plaintext) is\\nqueued in the same transaction (规划/02 §11). Minor rules follow the new birth_date.\\nAudit: every submission that passes the permission, step-up and body checks writes one\\naudit record (action user_realname_correct: admin, reason, result code, the new values\\nmasked or their id_no_hmac, never the plaintext), refusals included; a success also\\nrecords the masked before and after values (BR-ID-33). The name and the ID number never\\ngo into logs. The response is the user\'s real name as it is now, masked. No\\nIdempotency-Key (04 §6.6): a retry after a lost response is a new submission with its\\nown checks, vendor call and audit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10003,\n          10403,\n          20001,\n          30405,\n          30406,\n          30407,\n          30419,\n          44001,\n          50301,\n          50401\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminUserIdPath"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminStepUpToken"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminRealnameCorrectionRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "name": "张三",\n                "id_no": "11010519491231002X",\n                "reason": "用户先用家人身份实名，企业微信核对注册手机号、最近一笔订单号与身份证照片后改为本人"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "Corrected; the user\'s real name as it is now, masked.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminUserRealnameResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c01",\n                    "realname_status": "verified",\n                    "masked_name": "**三",\n                    "masked_id_no": "1****************X",\n                    "verified_at": "2026-11-03T10:00:00+08:00"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "description": "Not corrected (codes in contracts/error-codes.yaml).",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "stepUpRequired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminStepUpRequiredTotp"\n                  },\n                  "unknownUser": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminUnknownUser"\n                  },\n                  "reasonMissing": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminUserReasonInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "withdrawalInProgress": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminRealnameWithdrawalInProgress"\n                  },\n                  "accountDeleting": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminRealnameAccountDeleting"\n                  },\n                  "idNoInvalid": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminRealnameIdNoInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "idNoBlacklisted": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminRealnameIdNoBlacklisted"\n                  },\n                  "underAge": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminRealnameAgeRefused"\n                  },\n                  "idNoTaken": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminRealnameIdNoTaken"\n                  },\n                  "mismatch": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminRealnameMismatch"\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/admin/v1/users/{user_id}/data-exports": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "adminCreateUserDataExport",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-users"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Register a request for a user\'s personal information copy (audited, asynchronous)",\n        "description": "Permission point `user.data_export` (04 §11.2); lacking it is 10403 with\\n`data.reason=admin_permission_denied`. Step-up: totp tier (without a valid totp-tier\\n`X-Step-Up-Token` → 10003 with `data.tier=totp`). The user asks for a copy of their\\npersonal information in a WeCom (企业微信) conversation; the agent checks the identity\\nthere by hand and registers the request here (BR-ID-40; 04 §6.6 users/{id}/data-exports).\\nBody (20001 with `data.fields` naming a missing or invalid field): `reason` (1–200\\ncharacters, including the agent\'s written conclusion of the identity check) and the two\\nchannel facts the agent confirmed in the conversation, `app_login_ok` (the user can sign\\nin to the App) and `phone_sms_ok` (the bound phone number can receive SMS). An unknown\\n`user_id`, or one of another app, is 20001 with `data.fields=[user_id]`.\\nThen, first hit wins:\\n1. Account state (BR-ID-40 细则「副本请求与注销状态」): an account whose deletion is\\n   processing is not accepted (30419 with `data.reason=account_deleting` and\\n   `data.stage=processing`), nor one whose deletion is done (30419 with\\n   `data.reason=account_deleted`, no `data.stage`); the cooling period is accepted as\\n   usual.\\n2. An unfinished request of the user (pending, running or ready; at most one) is returned\\n   instead of creating one, with `reused=true`; the channel facts of this call are not\\n   judged. Exception (BR-ID-40 细则「重新登记与登记人停用」): a `wecom_session` request\\n   not yet delivered whose registrant\'s admin account is disabled, or who no longer\\n   holds both `user.data_export` and `pii.reveal_phone`, is set to failed now and a new\\n   request is created as in the next point.\\n3. Delivery from the channel facts: both true → `in_app_sms`, which also needs a bound\\n   phone number (else 20001 with `data.fields=[phone_sms_ok]`); both false →\\n   `wecom_session` (the `reason` must say why the in-app message and the phone cannot be\\n   used), which needs the caller to hold `pii.reveal_phone` as well (else 10403 with\\n   `data.reason=admin_permission_denied`; the registrant is the only one who can\\n   download it); only one true → not accepted, pending legal confirmation (30419 with\\n   `data.reason=delivery_undecided`; BR-ID-40, 规划/06 Q-F17).\\n30419 is 08 §13.11\'s code for an assisted request the user is not accepted for now (only\\nin /admin/v1).\\nA new request starts in pending (`reused=false`). `due_at` is the end (24:00 +08:00) of\\nthe 15th working day after the registration day (the registration day itself not counted; working days as in BR-ID-27); when the user\'s latest\\nrequest is failed, or a `wecom_session` one that expired without being delivered, the\\nnew request records it in `retry_of` and keeps its `due_at` (the time limit counts from\\nthe first registration). The copy is generated asynchronously (scope in BR-ID-40 细则\\n「导出范围」) into a private object-storage bucket; `expires_at` is 24 hours after\\ngeneration (BR-ID-30 ⑨). `in_app_sms`: the file is encrypted with a one-time extraction\\ncode, an in-app message carries only an entry to the App page `DataCopy` (no link), the\\ncode goes by SMS to the bound phone number and the request is delivered at once; the\\nuser downloads through GET /v1/me/data-copies/{id}/download. `wecom_session`: the\\nrequest stays ready until the registrant downloads it (POST\\n/admin/v1/users/{user_id}/data-exports/{export_id}/download). The template codes of the\\nin-app message and the SMS are fixed with the implementation; the wording waits for\\nBR-TEXT.\\nAudit (BR-ID-40): every registration that passes the permission, step-up and body checks\\nwrites one audit record (action user_data_copy_request: admin, user, reason, the two\\nchannel facts, the result — created, reused with the returned request\'s id, or the\\nrefusal code); generating and delivering write their own records. No Idempotency-Key\\n(04 §6.6): a retry returns the unfinished request with `reused=true`.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10003,\n          10403,\n          20001,\n          30419\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminUserIdPath"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminStepUpToken"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminUserDataExportCreateRequest"\n              },\n              "examples": {\n                "inAppSms": {\n                  "summary": "The user can sign in and receive SMS (delivered in the App)",\n                  "value": {\n                    "reason": "企业微信核对注册时间、最近一笔订单号与绑定手机号后四位，确认本人申请副本",\n                    "app_login_ok": true,\n                    "phone_sms_ok": true\n                  }\n                },\n                "wecomSession": {\n                  "summary": "Neither the App nor the phone works (delivered in the WeCom conversation)",\n                  "value": {\n                    "reason": "手机丢失、旧号已停用无法收短信，App 登不上；企业微信核对身份证照片与最近三笔订单后确认本人",\n                    "app_login_ok": false,\n                    "phone_sms_ok": false\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The new request (pending), or the user\'s unfinished one (`reused=true`).",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminUserDataExportCreateResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "export_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5d01",\n                    "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c01",\n                    "delivery": "in_app_sms",\n                    "status": "pending",\n                    "requested_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b01",\n                    "requested_by_name": "cs01",\n                    "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:00:00+08:00",\n                    "due_at": "2026-11-24T00:00:00+08:00",\n                    "retry_of": null,\n                    "generated_at": null,\n                    "delivered_at": null,\n                    "expires_at": null,\n                    "failure_reason": null,\n                    "reused": false\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "description": "No request registered (codes in contracts/error-codes.yaml).",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "stepUpRequired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminStepUpRequiredTotp"\n                  },\n                  "unknownUser": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminUnknownUser"\n                  },\n                  "reasonMissing": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminUserReasonInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "noPhone": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminDataExportPhoneMissing"\n                  },\n                  "accountDeleting": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminDataExportAccountDeleting"\n                  },\n                  "accountDeleted": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminDataExportAccountDeleted"\n                  },\n                  "deliveryUndecided": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminDataExportDeliveryUndecided"\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "adminListUserDataExports",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-users"\n        ],\n        "summary": "The personal information copy requests of one user",\n        "description": "Permission point `user.data_export` (04 §11.2; read only, no step-up); lacking it is\\n10403 with `data.reason=admin_permission_denied`. Every request of the user, whoever\\nregistered it, newest first (`created_at` descending, then the server\'s internal order\\nfor the same time), page by page (`page`, `page_size` ≤ 200, above that 20001). Each row\\nhas the status, the delivery, `due_at`, `expires_at` and `retry_of`, never a link, an\\nextraction code or a password (04 §6.6). An unknown `user_id`, or one of another app, is\\n20001 with `data.fields=[user_id]`. Status names come from the console dictionary\\n(BR-TEXT-25 admin_dict), not from this contract. Listing does not write an audit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminUserIdPath"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPage"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPageSize"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "One page of the user\'s requests, newest first.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminUserDataExportPageResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "items": [\n                      {\n                        "export_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5d02",\n                        "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c01",\n                        "delivery": "wecom_session",\n                        "status": "ready",\n                        "requested_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b02",\n                        "requested_by_name": "cs02",\n                        "created_at": "2026-11-05T15:00:00+08:00",\n                        "due_at": "2026-11-24T00:00:00+08:00",\n                        "retry_of": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5d01",\n                        "generated_at": "2026-11-05T15:03:00+08:00",\n                        "delivered_at": null,\n                        "expires_at": "2026-11-06T15:03:00+08:00",\n                        "failure_reason": null\n                      },\n                      {\n                        "export_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5d01",\n                        "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c01",\n                        "delivery": "wecom_session",\n                        "status": "failed",\n                        "requested_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b01",\n                        "requested_by_name": "cs01",\n                        "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:00:00+08:00",\n                        "due_at": "2026-11-24T00:00:00+08:00",\n                        "retry_of": null,\n                        "generated_at": "2026-11-02T10:04:00+08:00",\n                        "delivered_at": null,\n                        "expires_at": "2026-11-03T10:04:00+08:00",\n                        "failure_reason": "登记人的后台账号已停用"\n                      }\n                    ],\n                    "page": 1,\n                    "page_size": 20,\n                    "total": 2\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a