es_at` has passed\\nwithout a callback), `succeeded` (the credential, auth_expires_at, auth_renewed_at and\\nauth_renewed_by were updated and audited, BR-ID-24 ③), `failed` (the callback came back\\nwithout a usable grant; `error` holds the recorded cause) or `expired`. `error` is a\\nshort cause recorded by the server, never a token, code or credential; its values are\\nregistered with B1-22 and are not an enum here yet. `finished_at` is set with the final\\nstatus. An unknown `union_account_id` is 20001 with `data.fields=[union_account_id]`; an\\nunknown `session_id`, or one of another union account, is 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[session_id]`.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminUnionAccountIdPath"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminUnionSessionIdPath"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The session as it is now.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminUnionReauthResultResponse"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "succeeded": {\n                    "summary": "Renewed",\n                    "value": {\n                      "code": 0,\n                      "msg": "",\n                      "data": {\n                        "session_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f6c01",\n                        "union_account_id": "0199