                 }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/admin/v1/appeals": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "adminListAppeals",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-appeals"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Appeals to handle (filters, page by page, four counts)",\n        "description": "The risk appeal console (风控申诉页; 04 §6.6 appeals; BR-ID-36). Permission point\\n`risk.appeal` (04 §11.2; read only, no step-up); lacking it is 10403 with\\n`data.reason=admin_permission_denied` (a super admin holds every point). Every appeal of\\nthe console\'s app: the account and order appeals users submitted in the app (POST\\n/v1/me/appeals) and the appeals customer service registered here (POST\\n/admin/v1/appeals), blocked_request appeals included.\\n\\nFilters combine with AND: `status` (enum appeal_status), `overdue`, `target_type` (enum\\nappeal_target_type) and `q`. `overdue=true` keeps only the appeals still processing whose\\n`deadline_at` has passed (the internal time limit of BR-ID-36: the 3rd working day 24:00\\n+08:00 after submission); `overdue=false` or absent filters nothing. `q` is trimmed of\\nsurrounding whitespace, then it must be 1–64 characters, else 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[q]`; it matches exactly (no prefix or partial match) an appeal_id (the\\ndisplay number of an appeal is its appeal_id; there is no separate appeal number) or the\\nUID (user_id) of the appellant. A filter set nothing matches is an empty page\\n(`items=[]`, `total=0`), not an error. A value outside an enum is 20001 with\\n`data.fields` naming the parameter.\\n\\nOrder: `created_at` descending, then the server\'s internal order for the same time. Pages\\nwith `page` (any positive integer, as AdminPage; a page past the last one is\\n`items=[]`) and `page_size` ≤ 200 (above 200 is 20001, as AdminPageSize). `counts` has\\nfour numbers, each counted with every filter of the request except `status` and\\n`overdue`, so the console\'s four tabs show what each would hold: `processing` (status\\nprocessing), `overdue` (processing and past `deadline_at`; a part of `processing`),\\n`closed` (upheld or revoked) and `all`; `total` is the count of the page\'s own filter\\nset.\\n\\nThe appellant is shown as user_id and phone number masked 3 + 4 (BR-ID-33), never the\\nfull number (only through POST /admin/v1/users/{user_id}/reveal, 04 §11.1); `user` is\\nnull for a register-type blocked_request appeal (no account). Reading does not write an\\naudit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPage"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPageSize"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminAppealStatusFilter"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminAppealOverdueFilter"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminAppealTargetTypeFilter"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminAppealQuery"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "One page of appeals, newest submitted first, with the four counts.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminAppealPageResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "items": [\n                      {\n                        "appeal_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5d01",\n                        "user": {\n                          "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c01",\n                          "phone_masked": "138****5678"\n                        },\n                        "target_type": "account",\n                        "target_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c01",\n                        "target_no": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c01",\n                        "request_type": null,\n                        "prev_risk_state": "banned",\n                        "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:00:00+08:00",\n                        "deadline_at": "2026-11-06T00:00:00+08:00",\n                        "status": "processing",\n                        "handler_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b01",\n                        "handler_name": "客服小林"\n                      },\n                      {\n                        "appeal_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5d02",\n                        "user": null,\n                        "target_type": "blocked_request",\n                        "target_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5e01",\n                        "target_no": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5e01",\n                        "request_type": "register",\n                        "prev_risk_state": null,\n                        "created_at": "2026-10-12T11:30:00+08:00",\n                        "deadline_at": "2026-10-16T00:00:00+08:00",\n                        "status": "processing",\n                        "handler_id": null,\n                        "handler_name": null\n                      }\n                    ],\n                    "page": 1,\n                    "page_size": 20,\n                    "total": 2,\n        