tAdminReconDiff",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-recon"\n        ],\n        "summary": "One reconciliation difference of source R1–R3 with its handling summary",\n        "description": "The 差错单 detail of the reconciliation console (01 F-ADM-08; 04 §3.2 recon_diffs;\\ndesign/specs/admin-recon.md §4). Read only, no step-up. Permission point: any of\\n`fund.recon` or `fund.view` (04 §11.1, §11.2). The fields of a list row, plus the admin\\nwho handled it (`handler_id`, null until someone handles it), `updated_at` and\\n`resolution`: the stored handling summary (recon_diffs.resolution, an object, null while\\nunhandled), returned for display only; its keys are not fixed by this contract and\\nclients must not branch on them. An unknown `recon_diff_id`, a difference of another app,\\nor one of source R4 (see GET /admin/v1/pay-recon-diffs) is 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[recon_diff_id]` (no 404). No user phone number or other personal data is\\nreturned. Reading does not write an audit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminReconDiffIdPath"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The reconciliation difference with its handling summary.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminReconDiffDetailResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "