izeInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "adminCreateAdjustment",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-adjustments"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Submit a manual adjustment or a whole-form reversal, effective in one step (提交并生效)",\n        "description": "The only way a person adjusts a member\'s balance (BR-FUND-24; 04 §3.2 admin_adjustments;\\ndesign/specs/admin-adjustments.md 新建抽屉, 红冲对话框, and the 【调整余额】 of the user detail).\\nOne submission saves and approves at once: there is no 保存待批 and no 撤回, and the form\\nis born APPROVED with `reviewed_by` equal to `created_by` (BR-FUND-24 细则「后台入口」, owner\\n2026-10-18 ②; ADD-05). Permission point `fund.adjust` (04 §11.2). Step-up: sms tier\\n(BR-ID-34): without a valid sms-tier `X-Step-Up-Token`, a totp-tier token included → 10003\\nwith `data.tier=sms`; an account without a registered verify phone also gets\\n`data.reason=verify_phone_missing`.\\n\\nRequest, one of two closed shapes (AdminAdjustmentCreateRequest):\\n\\n- A new adjustment: `user_id`; `direction`; `amount_fen`, integer fen > 0, no upper limit\\n  (BR-FUND-24 ④); `reason_code`, one of RECON_FIX, PAYOUT_RECOVERY or OTHER. RESTORE comes\\n  only from a difference (BR-FUND-22) and ACCOUNT_CLOSED only from the system (BR-FUND-24\\n  ⑧), so neither can be chosen: 20001 at the schema. `refs`, the linked documents, at\\n  most 10, without duplicates (`data.fields=[refs]`); `note`, the internal explanation,\\n  at most 500 characters and not blank after trimming (blank → `data.fields=[note]`),\\n  required for OTHER (`data.fields=[note]`); `contra_subject` with `contra_platform`, see\\n  below.\\n- A reversal: `reverses_adjust_id` and `note`, the reason for the reversal, required, as\\n  above. The request carries no direction, amount, reason code, refs or subject: the\\n  server takes them from the original (opposite direction, the original `amount_fen`,\\n  whole form only, the same `reason_code`, `contra_subject` and `contra_platform`), and\\n  any of those fields in the request is 20001 at the schema (BR-FUND-24 细则「红冲只按原单整笔」).\\n  To correct +500 to +50: reverse the whole +500, then submit a new +50.\\n\\nWhat `data.fields` lists depends on where the body is refused. The schema comes first and\\nreports both shapes: a body that fits neither shape (a `reason_code` of RESTORE or\\nACCOUNT_CLOSED, a `note` over 500 characters, more than 10 `refs`, an `amount_fen` of 0, a\\nvalue outside an enum, a missing required field, a field of the other shape) is 20001\\nwith `data.fields` listing what fails in each of the two shapes, usually fields of the\\nother shape too, plus `body`; it does not single out the field at fault. Every\\n`data.fields` naming one field in this description is a check the service makes after the\\nbody has fit one shape.\\n\\nLinked documents by reason code (BR-FUND-24 ②③), all refused as 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[refs]`: RECON_FIX needs at least one `recon_diff`. PAYOUT_RECOVERY needs at\\nleast one `recon_diff` and exactly one `withdrawal`. OTHER needs at least one document of\\nany type, or none at all when `note` is the 客服处理说明 that stands in for it (③; `note`\\nis required for OTHER either way). `ref_id` is `recon_diffs.id`, `withdrawals.id`, the\\n`order_key` of a sub-order, or `deletion_requests.id`.\\n\\nContra subject (BR-FUND-24 ⑥; specs/ledger-rules.md §6, whitelist pending the finance\\nconfirmation): for RECON_FIX and OTHER the operator chooses `contra_subject` from\\nCOMMISSION_REVENUE, UNION_RECEIVABLE, BAD_DEBT or MKT_EXPENSE (missing → 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[contra_subject]`, another value fails at the schema); `contra_platform` is\\nrequired exactly for UNION_RECEIVABLE (else `data.fields=[contra_platform]`). For\\nPAYOUT_RECOVERY both are refused (20001 on the field): the server takes the cash subject\\nfrom the withdrawal\'s channel (CASH_ALIPAY, CASH_WECHAT or CASH_BANK).\\n\\nThe route schema runs first (D10-590 ⑥, as every console route): a malformed body is 20001\\nbefore any of the checks below, with or without `fund.adjust`, and writes no audit record.\\nOrder of checks: `fund.adjust` (10403 with `data.reason=admin_permission_denied`; the\\nrefusal writes an audit record, action adjustment_denied, BR-FUND-24 例（无权限）) → step-up\\n(10003) → body (20001: the schema, then the checks above) → an unknown `user_id` or one of\\nanother app is 20001 with `data.fields=[user_id]`; an unknown `reverses_adjust_id` or one\\nof another app is 20001 with `data.fields=[reverses_adjust_id]`; a `ref_id` that names\\nnothing of the app, a `recon_diff` of source R4 (a 收款对账 difference never leads to a\\nbalance adjustment, BR-PAY-07; see AdminReconDiffIdPath), or a `withdrawal` or\\n`account_deletion` of another member, is 20001 with `data.fields=[refs]` and\\n`data.reason=adjust_ref_invalid` → an original already reversed\\nis 20902 with `data.resource=admin_adjustment` (a form can be reversed once, BR-FUND-16;\\nthe console refreshes and shows 已红冲; the unique constraint on `reverses_adjust_id`\\nanswers the same under a race) → the guards, each refusal 20001: an original that is not\\nAPPROVED, or that is itself a reversal, with `data.fields=[reverses_adjust_id]` and\\n`data.reason=reverse_not_allowed`; a member already deleted with the field of the request\\n(`user_id` or `reverses_adjust_id`) and `data.reason=adjust_user_deleted`; a member in\\ndeletion (users.status deleting) takes no new manual form, only the reversal of an approved\\nACCOUNT_CLOSED form (D10-590 ④), anything else 20001 with the field of the request and\\n`data.reason=adjust_user_deleted`.\\n\\nEffects, in one transaction under the member\'s balance lock: the balance is read again\\nand the form (`status=APPROVED`) and its ADMIN_ADJUST voucher (sub_type = `reason_code`)\\nare written, an increase debiting the contra subject and crediting\\nUSER_BALANCE.available, a decrease the other way round. The voucher uniq_key is\\n`ADJ:{adjust_id}`, and `ADJ:{original adjust_id}:REVERSE` for a reversal, posted with the\\nreversal templates of specs/ledger-rules.md §5. A decrease, a reversal included, may take\\n`available` below 0 (BR-FUND-24 ⑤, BR-FUND-10); `frozen` is never written. Linking a\\ndifference does not change its status: it is closed through its own operations. Writes an\\naudit record (action adjustment_create or adjustment_reverse, with the `adjust_id`, the\\n`user_id`, the direction, amount and reason code, `available` before and after and, for\\na reversal, the original; no personal data). What the member sees (one ADMIN_ADJUST line\\nin the balance history, the in-app message on a decrease; BR-FUND-24 ⑦, BR-TEXT-19) is not\\npart of this response.\\n\\n`Idempotency-Key` is required: same key and body → the first result; same key with\\nanother body → 20901; same key while still running → 40901. The step-up token is a header\\nand not part of the body hash, so a replay after a 10003 keeps its key.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10003,\n          10403,\n          20001,\n          20901,\n          20902,\n          40901\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminStepUpToken"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminAdjustmentCreateRequest"\n              },\n              "examples": {\n                "adjustment": {\n                  "summary": "A new decrease recovering a duplicate payout",\n                  "value": {\n                    "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c02",\n                    "direction": "decrease",\n                    "amount_fen": 10000,\n                    "reason_code": "PAYOUT_RECOVERY",\n                    "refs": [\n                      {\n                        "ref_type": "withdrawal",\n                        "ref_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f7d01"\n                      },\n                      {\n                        "ref_type": "recon_diff",\n                        "ref_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f8e02"\n                      }\n                    ],\n                    "note": "迟到成功重复出款，追回"\n                  }\n                },\n                "reversal": {\n                  "summary": "A whole-form reversal; direction and amount come from the original",\n                  "value": {\n                    "reverses_adjust_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4fa001",\n                    "note": "差错单核对有误，整笔冲回"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The adjustment in effect with the available balance before and after, or the first result of the same key.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminAdjustmentExecutedResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "adjustment": {\n                      "adjust_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4fa001",\n                      "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c02",\n                      "direction": "decrease",\n                      "amount_fen": 10000,\n                      "reason_code": "PAYOUT_RECOVERY",\n                      "refs": [\n                        {\n                          "ref_type": "withdrawal",\n                          "ref_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f7d01"\n                        },\n                        {\n                          "ref_type": "recon_diff",\n                          "ref_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f8e02"\n                        }\n                      ],\n                      "contra_subject": "CASH_ALIPAY",\n                      "contra_platform": null,\n                      "note": "迟到成功重复出款，追回",\n                      "status": "APPROVED",\n                      "reverses_adjust_id": null,\n                      "reversed_by_adjust_id": null,\n                      "created_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b01",\n                      "created_at": "2026-11-30T10:30:00+08:00",\n                      "reviewed_by": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5b01",\n                      "reviewed_at": "2026-11-30T10:30:00+08:00",\n                      "reject_note": null,\n                      "voucher_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4fa101"\n                    },\n                    "available_before_fen": 3000,\n                    "available_after_fen": -7000\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "description": "Not submitted (codes in contracts/error-codes.yaml).",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "stepUpRequired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminStepUpRequiredSms"\n                  },\n                  "verifyPhoneMissing": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminVerifyPhoneMissing"\n                  },\n                  "reasonCodeNotChoosable": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentReasonCodeInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "refsMissing": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentRefsInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "refUnknown": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentRefInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "alreadyReversed": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentConflict"\n                  },\n                  "reverseNotAllowed": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentReverseNotAllowed"\n                  },\n                  "userDeleted": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentUserDeleted"\n                  },\n                  "idempotencyConflict": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentIdempotencyConflict"\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/admin/v1/adjustments/{adjust_id}": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "adminGetAdjustment",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-adjustments"\n        ],\n        "summary": "One manual adjustment, with a balance preview while it can still be executed",\n        "description": "One form of the 调账单 tab (01 F-ADM-08; 04 §3.2 admin_adjustments;\\ndesign/specs/admin-adjustments.md 批准对话框, 红冲对话框). Read only, no step-up. Permission\\npoint: any of `fund.adjust` or `fund.view` (04 §11.1, §11.2). `adjustment` is the list\\nrow, next to it `balance_preview`: what executing the form now would do to `available` (BR-FUND-24\\n④). Only two kinds of form have one: a PENDING form, whose amount is the current\\n`available` (0 when `available` is not above 0, see POST .../approve), and an APPROVED\\nform that is not a reversal, has not been reversed and whose member is not deleted,\\npreviewing its reversal. Every other form has `balance_preview=null`, so also an APPROVED\\nform of a deleted member, whose reversal POST /admin/v1/adjustments refuses with\\n`adjust_user_deleted`: the available balance before and after an executed form is read\\nfrom its voucher, and is not kept on the form. The preview is a reading, not\\na promise: approving and reversing read the balance again in their own transaction. An\\nunknown `adjust_id` or a form of another app is 20001 with `data.fields=[adjust_id]` (no\\n404). Reading does not write an audit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminAdjustmentIdPath"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The adjustment with its balance preview.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminAdjustmentDetailResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "adjustment": {\n                      "adjust_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4fa002",\n                      "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c03",\n                      "direction": "decrease",\n                      "amount_fen": null,\n                      "reason_code": "ACCOUNT_CLOSED",\n                      "refs": [\n                        {\n                          "ref_type": "account_deletion",\n                          "ref_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4fa301"\n                        }\n                      ],\n                      "contra_subject": "COMMISSION_REVENUE",\n                      "contra_platform": null,\n                      "note": null,\n                      "status": "PENDING",\n                      "reverses_adjust_id": null,\n                      "reversed_by_adjust_id": null,\n                      "created_by": null,\n                      "created_at": "2026-12-01T02:00:00+08:00",\n                      "reviewed_by": null,\n                      "reviewed_at": null,\n                      "reject_note": null,\n                      "voucher_id": null\n                    },\n                    "balance_preview": {\n                      "direction": "decrease",\n                      "amount_fen": 2000,\n                      "available_before_fen": 2000,\n                      "available_after_fen": 0\n                    }\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "description": "Not available (codes in contracts/error-codes.yaml).",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"\n                },\n                "examples": {\n                  "adjustmentInvalid": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminAdjustmentIdInvalid"\n                  },\n                  "noPermission": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminPermissionDenied"\n                  },\n                  "tokenExpired": {\n                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/AdminTokenExpired"\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/admin/v1/adjustments/{adjust_id}/approve": {\n      "post": {\n        "operationId": "adminApproveAdjustment",\n        "tags": [\n          "admin-adjustments"\n        ],\n        "summary": "Approve a system-prefilled ACCOUNT_CLOSED form; the amount is taken at approval",\n        "description": "The 【批准并短信验证】 of the 批准对话框 (BR-FUND-24 ①⑧, BR-ID-28;\\ndesign/specs/admin-adjustments.md). Only a PENDING form can be approved, and the only\\nPENDING forms are the ACCOUNT_CLOSED decreases the system prefills when a deletion reaches\\nprocessing: a form a person submits is APPROVED from the start. Permission point\\n`fund.adjust` (04 §11.2). Step-up: sms tier (BR-ID-34): without a valid sms-tier\\n`X-Step-Up-Token`, a totp-tier token included → 10003 with `data.tier=sms`; an account\\nwithout a registered verify phone also gets `data.reason=verify_phone_missing`.\\n\\nRequest: an empty object. The console sends no amount: `amount_fen` is the member\'s\\n`available` when this operation runs, which may differ from the preview.\\n\\nOrder of checks: `fund.adjust` (10403 with `data.reason=admin_permission_denied`) → step-up\\n(10003) → body (20001) → an unknown `adjust_id` or a form of another app is 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[adjust_id]` (no 404) → a form that is no longer PENDING is 20902 with\\n`data.resource=admin_adjustment` (refresh) → the balance is read again: `available` not\\nabove 0 is 20001 with `data.fields=[adjust_id]` and `data.reason=adjust_no_balance`,\\nnothing is written and the form stays PENDING (the amount of a form must be above 0; the\\noperator rejects it instead).\\n\\nEffects, in one transaction under the member\'s balance lock: `amount_fen` becomes the\\ncurrent `available`, the voucher ADMIN_ADJUST / ACCOUNT_CLOSED with uniq_key\\n`ADJ:{adjust_id}` debits USER_BALANCE.available and credits COMMISSION_REVENUE (BR-FUND-24\\n⑥), the form becomes APPROVED with `reviewed_by` the caller and `reviewed_at`,\\n`voucher_id` set. No in-app message is sent to a deleted member (BR-FUND-24 ⑧). Writes an\\naudit record (action adjustment_approve, with the `adjust_id`, the `user_id`, the amount\\nand `available` before and after; no personal data).\\n\\n`Idempotency-Key` is required: same key and body → the first result; same key with\\nanother body → 20901; same key while still running → 40901. The step-up token is a header\\nand not part of the body hash, so a replay after a 10003 keeps its key.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-idempotent": true,\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error