e current accounting day minus `negative_since`, derived and not\\nstored; `approve_blocked` is true when approving a PENDING candidate would be refused now\\n(the balance has frozen money and the switch `ledger.bad_debt_require_no_frozen.enabled`\\nis on, BR-FUND-12), so the console needs neither the switch nor its key. Filters combine\\nwith AND: `status`, `user_id`. A value outside an enum or pattern is 20001 with\\n`data.fields` naming the parameter; a `user_id` that names nothing of the app is an empty\\npage. Order: `created_at` descending (then `id` descending). Pages with `page` (as\\nAdminPage; a page past the last one is `items=[]`) and `page_size` ≤ 200 (above 200 is\\n20001, as AdminPageSize); `total` is the count of the filter set. Reading does not write\\nan audit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-implementation": "planned",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPage"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPageSize"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminBadDebtWriteoffStatusFilter"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminBadDebtWriteoffUserFilter"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "One page of write-off candidates, newest first.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminBadDebtWriteoffPageRespo