`hold_until`).\\nThere is no status history table for withdrawals (04 §3.2); the history of a withdrawal is\\nread from its stored time points (`created_at`, `auto_decision.decided_at`, `reviewed_at`\\nwith `reviewer_id`, `executed_at` with `executor_id`, `hold_at` with `hold_reason`,\\n`paid_at`, `updated_at`), the batch items and the transfer attempts; admin actions are in\\nthe audit log (GET /admin/v1/audit-logs). An unknown `withdrawal_id` or a withdrawal of\\nanother app is 20001 with `data.fields=[withdrawal_id]` (no 404). Reading does not write\\nan audit record.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminWithdrawalIdPath"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The withdrawal with its batch, transfer attempts, holds in effect, decision and risk flags.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminWithdrawalDetailResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "withdrawal_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f9a03",\n                    "out_biz_no": "W20261029000103",\n                    "user": {\n                      "user_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5c03",\n                      "phone_masked": "137****0001"\n                    },\n                    "status": "APPROVED",\n    