n past the limit, waiting for a person (未知结果处置)",\n        "description": "The list of the 24 hour unknown disposal page (01 F-ADM-07; BR-WDR-14, BR-WDR-15; ruling\\nD10-625). Read only, no step-up. Permission point `payout.execute` (BR-WDR-15 sets no point\\nof its own); a super admin holds every point. Reading does not write an audit record.\\n\\nRows are the withdrawals of the console\'s app in status PAYING with `needs_manual=true`,\\nlongest waiting first: `withdrawal_id`, `out_biz_no`, the masked `user` as in\\nlistAdminWithdrawals (no payee account or name), `payout_channel`, `amount_fen`, `net_fen`,\\n`first_transfer_at` (T, the earliest kind=transfer attempt), `latest_query` (the newest\\nkind=query attempt, null when there is none: `result`, `at`, and what the channel answered,\\n`resp_code`, `resp_sub_code`, `channel_status`, `channel_order_id` and `paid_at`, each null\\nwhen absent and never the payee\'s account or name, so that a person can read the answer and\\nuse it as proof), and `fail_blockers`, what\\nstops this withdrawal from being judged failed right now, in the order of\\nadminResolveUnknownPayout\'s checks. While the channel\'s 「订单不存在」 code and the bill read\\nare missing (D10-625) it always holds `resolve_bill_unverifiable` and\\n`resolve_query_unverifiable`, so the page can say why before anyone submits.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403,\n          20001\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPage"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminPageSize"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "One page of the withdrawals waiting for a person.",\n          