l` mean what they mean in GET\\n/admin/v1/fund-ledger, per channel (D10-285): `watermark` is null until a row exists, never a\\ndefault; no recent withdrawals give a forecast of 0, not null; `water_level` is `low` when W\\nis below 1.5 P, else `normal`, and null when there is no W or it has passed the 2 hour limit,\\nwhile `watermark.measured_at` still shows its age.\\n\\nNot part of this operation: the queue and the unknown results (their lists), and changing a\\nswitch (adminUpdateKillSwitch).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10403\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The overview at this moment.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminPayoutOverviewResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "as_of": "2026-11-03T10:00:00+08:00",\n                    "payout_enabled": true,\n                    "queue_paused": false,\n                    "single_cap_fen": 500000,\n                    "daily_cap_fen": 5000000,\n                    "daily_sent_fen": 120000,\n                    "watermark_usable_bp": 9000,\n                    "channels": [\n                      {\n                        "channel": "alipay",\n                        "enabled": true,\n                        "paused": false,\n                        "watermark": {\n                          "available_fen": 30000