e is 20001 with\\n`data.fields=[value]`. CAS: `expected_version` is the item\'s `version` the console showed\\n(0 for an item never written); a change adds 1 and stores a history version, and a\\nmismatch → 20902 with `data.resource=config_item`, refresh and retry (04 §6.6). Writing\\nthe value the item already has with a matching version succeeds without change. `reason`\\nis optional (at most 200 characters) and kept with the history version. Every change is\\nwritten to the audit log (action config_item_change, before and after values) and\\npushes an alert; it takes effect as the key\'s reader re-reads it (within that key\'s\\ncache period), never retroactively (04 §10). No Idempotency-Key (04 §6.6).\\n",\n        "x-auth": "admin",\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          10001,\n          10003,\n          10403,\n          20001,\n          20902\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {\n            "adminBearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/ConfigKeyPath"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AdminStepUpToken"\n          }\n        ],\n        "requestBody": {\n          "required": true,\n          "content": {\n            "application/json": {\n              "schema": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AdminConfigItemUpdateRequest"\n              },\n              "example": {\n                "value": 300,\n                "expected_version": 2,\n                "reason": "收藏上限调到 300"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The configuration item as it is now.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              