es up empty sessions\\n(no Idempotency-Key, 04 §5 幂等). After BR-ID-01 ①–⑦ the checks of BR-AI-23 ①–③ apply:\\n30501 (agent.enabled / whitelist, BR-AI-12) → 10001 or 10005 (the switches of BR-ID-03) →\\n10004 with consent_type=ai_third_party (BR-AI-13; nothing is created). x-auth is optional\\nalthough 04 §6.5 lists none, for the same reason as search and consents.\\nVersion gate: applied.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-min-version-gate": true,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          30501,\n          10001,\n          10005,\n          10004,\n          10405\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DeviceId"\n          }\n        ],\n        "responses": {\n          "200": {\n            "description": "The new session, or the owner\'s newest empty one.",\n            "headers": {\n              "X-Trace-Id": {\n                "$ref": "#/components/headers/TraceId"\n              }\n            },\n            "content": {\n              "application/json": {\n                "schema": {\n                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AgentSessionResponse"\n                },\n                "example": {\n                  "code": 0,\n                  "msg": "",\n                  "data": {\n                    "session_id": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-000000000021",\n                    "started_at": "2026-10-06T10:00:00+08:00",\n                    "last_active_at": "2026-10-06T10:00:00+08:00"\n                  },\n                  "trace_id": "0199a3b4-5c6d-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d3e4f5a6b"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          "429": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"\n          },\n          "4XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ClientError"\n          },\n          "5XX": {\n            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "/v1/agent/sessions/current": {\n      "get": {\n        "operationId": "getCurrentAgentSession",\n        "tags": [\n          "agent"\n        ],\n        "summary": "The current conversation",\n        "description": "The owner\'s most recently active unexpired session, or session=null (BR-AI-20; owner as in\\ncreateAgentSession, a token never falls back to the device\'s guest sessions). The app opens\\nit on start; there is no session list (拍板第二批 AI-23). Checks BR-AI-23 ①–③: 30501 →\\n10001 / 10005 → 10004.\\n",\n        "x-auth": "optional",\n        "x-signed": false,\n        "x-idempotent": false,\n        "x-error-codes": [\n          30501,\n          10001,\n          10005,\n          10004\n        ],\n        "security": [\n          {},\n          {\n            "bearerAuth": []\n          }\n        ],\n        "parameters": [\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Platform"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/AppVersion"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Build"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Channel"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TraceId"\n          },\n          {\n            "$ref":