  map.set('specs/request-sign.vectors.json', '{\n  "$comment": "Shared request-signing test vectors for the server and the three native clients (08 BR-ID-09 细则「服务端与三端共用一组签名测试向量」; CI checks every implementation against this file). Signing string = upper-case method + \\"\\\\n\\" + path without scheme or host, including the raw query string after \\"?\\" exactly as sent (same percent-encoding and parameter order; no sorting, decoding or dedup) + \\"\\\\n\\" + X-Timestamp + \\"\\\\n\\" + X-Nonce + \\"\\\\n\\" + lowercase_hex(sha256(raw body bytes)); an empty body hashes the empty string. X-Sign = lowercase_hex(HMAC-SHA256(key, signing string)), where the key is the UTF-8 bytes of install_secret. Fields: note = what the case exercises; method = the signing-string method component as given (not a client API argument that would be upper-cased first); path = the signed path; body_utf8 = the exact body text, encoded as UTF-8 bytes without JSON parsing or reserialization, empty string meaning zero bytes; timestamp = the literal X-Timestamp header value; server_time = the server clock in Unix seconds, injected for the skew check; nonce = the literal X-Nonce header value; install_secret = a test value, prefixed with test-, containing a dot, 16 to 128 characters (openapi RegisterDeviceData), never a real device key; expected_signing_string (valid cases only) = the signing string; expected_sign = the X-Sign; expected_reason (invalid cases only) = the single rule the case breaks. valid_cases pass every check: X-Timestamp is a 10-digit integer, |server_time - timestamp| <= 300 (exactly +300 and -300 are included), X-Nonce is 32 lower-case hex characters, method is upper case, path starts with \\"/\\" and has no scheme or host. invalid_cases each break exactly one rule, with every rule judged independently, and the server answers 10401: time_skew (|server_time - timestamp| > 300; +301 and -301 included), timestamp_format (not exactly 10 digits), nonce_length (not 32 characters), nonce_hex (contains a non-hex character), nonce_case (contains an upper-case letter), method_case (method not upper case), path_domain (path carries a scheme or host; a path starting with \\"//\\" always counts as carrying a host). The skew rule reads the timestamp leniently as a number (surrounding whitespace ignored), so each timestamp_format case either is not a number at all or has a numeric value within 300 s of server_time; for the 9- and 13-digit cases server_time is set to that same number, which is not a realistic clock but keeps the case isolated. Each nonce_length case is lower-case hex, so it breaks neither nonce_hex nor nonce_case. The expected_sign of an invalid case is computed over its fields verbatim: the method is not upper-cased and the path is not stripped of its host. method_case and path_domain are therefore not separate server checks: the server signs the upper-case method and the host-free request path, so such a request fails as a signature mismatch. Field order: never place nonce or any other 32- or 40-character hex field on the line right after install_secret (gitleaks rule cn-hex-secret also inspects the following line); expected_sign is 64 characters and is safe there. Not covered here: X-Device-Id validity (10402), nonce replay within 600 seconds per device_id, and the H5 bridge signing path (BR-ID-32).",\n  "version": 1,\n  "valid_cases": [\n    {\n      "note": "BR-ID-09 example: links open with query and JSON body, server time equals ts",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/links/abc/open?src=agent",\n      "body_utf8": "{\\"no_rebate\\":false}",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661600,\n      "nonce": "b5a8f07b9dda63c3f78ed24c341d25b3",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/links/abc/open?src=agent\\n1790661600\\nb5a8f07b9dda63c3f78ed24c341d25b3\\ne656157d50842895976f927a859fc8658503d498c2decbb994aba12bd18a1c5a",\n      "expected_sign": "5715b672cfc2e52a082392ba4d6997110ae6f9583dc076c6ce8b8df0bc9eeb66"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "empty body: sha256 of zero bytes (e3b0c442...b855)",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/links/abc/open",\n      "body_utf8": "",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661600,\n      "nonce": "815affc86096929c944a8b0d6a79627b",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/links/abc/open\\n1790661600\\n815affc86096929c944a8b0d6a79627b\\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",\n      "expected_sign": "2b235155f7b5c27ba65773b1bd043e67cf1ef5569dac05619ce8026af0bbc036"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "non-ASCII body (CJK, full-width punctuation, 4-byte emoji) hashed as raw UTF-8 bytes; spacing kept, no JSON reserialization",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/inputs/parse",\n      "body_utf8": "{\\"text\\": \\"复制这段文字打开 凑狸测试商品，¥99 👍\\"}",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661600,\n      "nonce": "8cc81ffe089dd190b5b8dfdb97fbcbe4",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/inputs/parse\\n1790661600\\n8cc81ffe089dd190b5b8dfdb97fbcbe4\\nb8175f9465d0d2e3951abe27a75d47d52ed0f7079a280eb71f7ae72e90e126ab",\n      "expected_sign": "8536f2f18d484b9b05d55aee03b68c6eb99cf8a1abb22f88cfa899c44c61fe09"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "unsorted, percent-encoded query kept as sent: no sorting, no decoding",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/links/convert?b=2&a=1&c=%E4%B8%AD",\n      "body_utf8": "{\\"url\\":\\"https://example.com/item?id=1\\"}",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661600,\n      "nonce": "e1d272c45ff3520a4e4c8aedd1ab33d6",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-b",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/links/convert?b=2&a=1&c=%E4%B8%AD\\n1790661600\\ne1d272c45ff3520a4e4c8aedd1ab33d6\\n85820a5732f799cce7ee14e34e7b6df81e40d792ede15b137be12a6f9739aecf",\n      "expected_sign": "6d81bf8813f0845403f36303b1676c8467b86a048c69e37e1f6377c5a494294a"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "repeated key, empty value and lower-case percent-encoding kept as sent: no dedup, no case normalisation",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/links/abc/open?tag=x&tag=a&empty=&q=%e4%b8%ad",\n      "body_utf8": "",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661600,\n      "nonce": "baf337a6e314562116d576e8902617f7",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-b",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/links/abc/open?tag=x&tag=a&empty=&q=%e4%b8%ad\\n1790661600\\nbaf337a6e314562116d576e8902617f7\\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",\n      "expected_sign": "1001c284ccd7e9e3cc7b00761d1449ee7a6930cdf9ab5365677754066b1cf4e7"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "time boundary: server_time - ts = +300 (client clock 300 s slow), accepted",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/withdrawals",\n      "body_utf8": "{\\"amount_cent\\":1000}",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661900,\n      "nonce": "a55de6e0a13c94258463aeb4c5e76144",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/withdrawals\\n1790661600\\na55de6e0a13c94258463aeb4c5e76144\\necf0347e0739fe7acc58ab7e16d7b2f7ed537430da4e3897b5c37b9e2176daa9",\n      "expected_sign": "c3bb190239c6e31586de2277199ab837a53ff717c718f05c6362445cfdbcc4ae"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "time boundary: server_time - ts = -300 (client clock 300 s fast), accepted",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/withdrawals",\n      "body_utf8": "{\\"amount_cent\\":1000}",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661300,\n      "nonce": "91819a5a76026e612f67d70b7eeb7c21",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-a",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/withdrawals\\n1790661600\\n91819a5a76026e612f67d70b7eeb7c21\\necf0347e0739fe7acc58ab7e16d7b2f7ed537430da4e3897b5c37b9e2176daa9",\n      "expected_sign": "4d1b29a030a24a26bea53b6500e970497233aef7d935f1d0a9e89ffe10b97a2c"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "PUT is signed too: save payout account (x-signed: true), non-ASCII JSON body",\n      "method": "PUT",\n      "path": "/v1/me/payout-account",\n      "body_utf8": "{\\"payout_method\\":\\"alipay\\",\\"alipay_logon_id\\":\\"test-payee@example.com\\",\\"payee_name\\":\\"测试用户\\"}",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661600,\n      "nonce": "dd0afc76e0e9a9de733e3315497fcb7e",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.device-b",\n      "expected_signing_string": "PUT\\n/v1/me/payout-account\\n1790661600\\ndd0afc76e0e9a9de733e3315497fcb7e\\n6ebdfc7ef5aff8ab8bcb7abb8234aa478bbb347dbc7b083bcba9c80466dee82b",\n      "expected_sign": "54d21ed682bc1c31a2e7f0f121520dbb807868ee017a41d38cadd9bf0d981a24"\n    },\n    {\n      "note": "install_secret longer than the 64-byte HMAC block (key is hashed first per RFC 2104)",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/auth/refresh",\n      "body_utf8": "",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661600,\n      "nonce": "ec7e1848879d741def3a23c93432acf2",\n      "install_secret": "test-only.install.key.longer.than.the.sixty-four.byte.hmac.block.size.so.it.is.hashed.first",\n      "expected_signing_string": "POST\\n/v1/auth/refresh\\n1790661600\\nec7e1848879d741def3a23c93432acf2\\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",\n      "expected_sign": "c082952ce98e6d897a86c4b9c836cd082c5e438d342f4f88416131452ec93abb"\n    }\n  ],\n  "invalid_cases": [\n    {\n      "note": "server_time - ts = +301 (client clock 301 s slow)",\n      "expected_reason": "time_skew",\n      "method": "POST",\n      "path": "/v1/links/abc/open?src=agent",\n      "body_utf8": "{\\"no_rebate\\":false}",\n      "timestamp": "1790661600",\n      "server_time": 1790661901,\n      "nonce": "bbec2abe48fcdc9ed